    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "5 reasons of why the mighty fall: \n\n1. Hubris Born of Success:\n\n2. Undisciplined Pursuit of More:\u2028\n3. Denial of Risk and Peril\u2028\u20284. Grasping for Salvation\u2028\n5.  Capitulation to Irrelevance or Death\u2028\u2028This usually happens when you get cocky.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2055454411044909070",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-16T01:04:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cIf you know the enemy and know yourself, you need not fear the result of a hundred battles. If you know yourself but not the enemy, for every victory gained you will also suffer a defeat. If you know neither the enemy nor yourself, you will succumb in every battle.\u201d\n\nSun Tzu",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2055120907207602345",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T02:59:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Alcohol use among high schoolers is falling fast.  \n\nThere\u2019s a massive opportunity here for Beer &amp; alcohol companies to pivot.  \n\nTheir future customers are less and less interested in their product.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2055055670974533758",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-14T22:40:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Iran may have found the world\u2019s biggest weakness.\n\n97% of global internet traffic runs through 750,000 miles of undersea cables.\n\nTouch those cables\u2026 and you don\u2019t just disrupt the internet.\n\nYou disrupt the global economy.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2054959334015049889",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-14T16:17:39+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "How many more Eileen\u2019s are out there in politics, Fortune 500 companies, universities and military?\n\n\nNew York Post (@nypost)\n\nArcadia mayor Eileen Wang admits acting as foreign agent for China in plea deal trib.al/sEhGV17\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/nypost/status/2053936239535874082#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2053951036516122682",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T21:31:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Never seen 20 security guards + police officers in the octagon before a fight.   \n\nTension is super high.  \n\nStrickland looks calm.  \nKhamzat looks impatient.  \n\nLet\u2019s see what happens.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2053326910415872258",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-10T04:10:59+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Respect to both fighters.  \n\nWhat an incredible fight.",
