    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What politicians like Mamdani are missing in 2026. \n\nIn 1970, 85% of S&amp;P 500 wealth was tied to tangible assets. Politicians could bully the wealthy because money couldn\u2019t move.\n\nToday, 90% is intangible: code, IP, capital.\n\nWealth is now mobile. Push too hard &amp; it leaves.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2052505214117085649",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T21:45:51+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
